- Code commit: `fcab764e fix(compat): remove extra MessageExt accessors`.
- Updated `PHASE_8_OFFLINE_METHOD_MATRIX.md`, `PHASE_6_REQUIREMENT_AUDIT.md`, and `docs/release-checklist.md` to record this bounded API closure. The broad P18-V01 bidirectional source/API/input/error/flow/reverse-export audit remains open.
- No push, release, or tag action taken. The Java reference checkout was not modified.

